Common Questions

How do I restore my purchases?
Open the App, go to Settings, and tap "Restore Purchases." This restores any purchases made previously with the same Apple ID (iOS) or Google account (Android).

My progress was lost. Can I get it back?
Game progress is saved locally on your device. If you deleted and reinstalled the App, local save data cannot be recovered. If you signed in with Apple or Google, your online profile and rankings are preserved with that account. Game Center and Play Games leaderboard scores are preserved with your Apple ID or Google account.

The game is crashing or not loading.
Try closing the App completely and reopening it. If the issue persists, make sure you are running the latest version from the App Store or Google Play. Restarting your device can also help.

How do I turn off ads?
You can purchase the one-time "Remove Ads" option from the in-game Store to permanently remove all ads.

How do I delete my account?
Email us at the address below from the address you signed in with (or include your in-game alias) and ask for account deletion. We remove your account and all associated online data within 30 days.

